{
  "@context": {
    "schema": "https://schema.org/"
  },
  "@type": "Note",
  "@id": "note:notion-367",
  "title": "Dimensions & Weights",
  "status": "draft",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b-1",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Dimensions & Weights"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-3",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Boxes"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **24x2 Kraft tube** – this is for the large rolling pins *this is the other box size that needs to be auto selected for the rolling pins. Currently, if someone orders a bag of flour + a rolling pin, EasyShip is selecting one box size, not two and I am losing all the money that covers the rolling pin shipping fee, because I have to manually divide the order onto two boxes and select the tube for the rolling pin. The customer has already checked out and paid, which means I can’t go back in and add the separate shipping fee for the rolling pin to their order. (0.32lbs)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "`$8.49`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x9x6 (S)**– this box holds up to 5 pounds of flour. *This isn’t currently in the system for EasyShip to automatically select. We have to manually select from a drop down menu of additional box sizes. So, right now, someone who orders one 1.5 pound bag or a single 2.5 pound bag gets thrown into the next box size up, which means they are over-paying for shipping."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "`$7.39`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x6 (M)** – this box holds greater than 5 pounds of flour and up to 10 pounds of flour"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-9",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "`$7.61`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-10",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x10 (L)** – this box holds greater than 10 pounds of flour and up to 20 pounds of flour."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-11",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "`"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-12",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x12 (XL)** – this box holds greater than 20 pounds of flour and up to 30 pounds of flour."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-13",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **13x13x13 (2XL)** – for gift boxes & pre-packaged class materials; thicker, more expensive holds greater than 30 pounds and up to 40 pounds."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-14",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Exact Dimensions"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-16",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x9x6:** 12 3/8 x 9 3/8 x 6 5/8 weight = .5lb,"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x6:** 12 3/8 x 12 3/8 x 6 5/8 weight = .75 lbs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x10:** 12 3/8 x 12 3/8 x 10 5/8 weight = .90 lbs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-19",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **12x12x12:** 12 3/8 x 12 3/8 x 12 5/8 weight = 1 lb"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-20",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- 13x13x13: 13 3/8 x 13 3/8 x 13 5/8 weight = 1.16lbs"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-21",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- They all say the measurements may be +/- 1/8\" not sure if we need that."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-23",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-22",
